.TH SCS-SERVER 1 "September 2026" "sslcrtsrv 0.8.4" "SSLCrtSrv Manual"
.SH NAME
scs-server \- SSLCrtSrv certificate distribution server
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B scs-server
.RI [ init " | " test-notifier ]
.RI [ options ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B scs-server
is the TCP server clients register and request certificates against. Run with
the
.B init
positional argument to create or update
.IR server_config.json ;
run with
.B test-notifier
to send a real test message through one configured notifier; run with no
arguments at all to actually start listening for client connections.
.PP
Re-running
.B init
against an existing config file prompts interactively to either overwrite it
completely (generating a new server identity keypair) or update just the
given options, keeping the existing keypair, registration secret, and any
options not mentioned this time.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BI "\-\-config " PATH
Config file path. Default
.IR /etc/sslcrtsrv/server_config.json .
Applies to all modes.
.PP
The following apply to
.B init
only, and are written into the config file:
.TP
.BI "\-\-listen " ADDR
Listen address. Default
.IR 0.0.0.0 .
.TP
.BI "\-\-port " N
Listen port. Default
.IR 5514 .
.TP
.BI "\-\-bind\-also " HOST : PORT
Repeatable; adds one more address/port the server also listens on, handled
identically to the primary one. Use
.RI [ HOST ]: PORT
for IPv6.
.TP
.BI "\-\-datadir " PATH
Relocates the SQLite database to
.IR PATH /keysrv.db .
Default
.IR /opt/sslcrtsrv .
.TP
.BI "\-\-certdir " PATH
Where certificate files are stored on disk. Default
.IR /opt/sslcrtsrv/certs .
.TP
.BI "\-\-syslog\-host " HOST ", \-\-syslog\-port " PORT ", \-\-syslog\-facility " FACILITY
Log the running server process to a remote syslog server instead of the local
one. Defaults: no host (uses the local
.IR /dev/log ),
port
.IR 514 ,
facility
.IR daemon .
.TP
.BI "\-\-registration\-secret " SECRET
Sets the shared client-registration secret explicitly, instead of generating
one.
.TP
.BI "\-\-default\-acme\-provider " NAME
Default
.IR letsencrypt .
.TP
.BI "\-\-client\-package " NAME : PATH : VERSION [: DESCRIPTION ]
Repeatable; upserts one entry into the downloadable client-package catalog.
.TP
.BI "\-\-notifier " NAME : TYPE : key = value [, key = value ...]
Repeatable; upserts one admin notifier.
.I TYPE
is one of
.BR email ", " webhook ", " pushover ", " pushsafer ", " gotify ", " ntfy .
.TP
.BI "\-\-notify\-on " EVENT : NAME [, NAME ...]
Repeatable; upserts one event's routing to notifier name(s).
.I EVENT
is one of
.BR registration ", " certificate_request ", " error .
.TP
.BI "\-\-notification\-rate\-limit " MAX
Global cap on notifications per window for any notifier with no more specific
override. Default
.IR 10 ;
.I 0
or less disables the cap entirely.
.TP
.BI "\-\-notification\-rate\-limit\-window " SECONDS
Global rate-limit window length. Default
.IR 300 .
.TP
.BI "\-\-notification\-rate\-limit\-for " NAME : MAX [: WINDOW ]
Repeatable; upserts one named rate-limit override.
.I WINDOW
is optional, inheriting the global window if omitted.
.TP
.BI "\-\-db\-backend " "{sqlite,mysql,postgresql}"
Database backend. Omit to keep the sqlite/
.B \-\-datadir
default.
.TP
.BI "\-\-db\-host " HOST ", \-\-db\-port " PORT ", \-\-db\-user " USER ", \-\-db\-password " PASSWORD ", \-\-db\-name " NAME
mysql/postgresql connection details.
.B \-\-db\-port
defaults to 3306/5432 respectively if omitted.
.TP
.BR \-\-acme\-enabled ", " \-\-no\-acme\-enabled
Enable/disable
.BR scs-acme-server (1),
the optional RFC 8555 ACME protocol listener. Omit to leave whatever is
already configured (or unset/disabled, for a new config) untouched.
.B \-\-acme\-external\-url
is also required before
.B scs-acme-server
will actually start.
.TP
.BI "\-\-acme\-external\-url " URL
Externally-visible base URL of the ACME endpoint, behind the mandatory
reverse proxy in front of
.BR scs-acme-server \(em
e.g.
.IR https://ca.example.com/acme .
Required for
.B \-\-acme\-enabled
to take effect.
.TP
.BI "\-\-acme\-listen " ADDR
Local address
.B scs-acme-server
binds to, behind the reverse proxy. Default
.IR 127.0.0.1 .
.TP
.BI "\-\-acme\-port " N
Local port
.B scs-acme-server
binds to. Default
.IR 5580 .
.PP
The following applies to
.B test-notifier
only:
.TP
.BI "\-\-notifier\-name " NAME
Which configured notifier to send a test message through.
.SH FILES
.I /etc/sslcrtsrv/server_config.json
\(em default configuration file.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR scs-crtmanager (1),
.BR scs-cltmanager (1),
.BR scs-client (1),
.BR scs-crtrequest (1),
.BR scs-admintui (1),
.BR scs-dbmigrate (1),
.BR scs-acme-server (1)
.PP
The project's
.I Manual.MD
has the full narrative reference.
